# packages/proton-lunx/source.env -- the ONE pin for the lunx custom Proton
# (aarch64 GE-Proton 11-4 + the proton-ds5-haptic patch series).
#
# Author: Pedro Nascimento <pnascimento@gmail.com>
#
# What this is: a buildable, installable aarch64 Proton for the Odin 2 Portal,
# based on GE-Proton 11-4 ("Controller fixup", tag GE-Proton11-4) carrying the
# proton-ds5-haptic patch series so DualSense-aware games' 4-channel haptic
# audio routes to the virtual PipeWire DualSense device (US-78/79 graph).
#
# WHY a multi-source git build and not the ordinary one-pin package:
#   * the load-bearing content (wine patches, the proton script, the
#     pipewire-alsa aux-channel plugin) lives in a GE-Proton release plus its
#     submodules. There is no release tarball that contains the wine tree;
#     wine is a submodule pinned to a commit.
#   * SOURCE_URL/SOURCE_SHA256 below pin the GE-Proton-11-4 TOP-LEVEL tree
#     (the one thing tools/stage.sh stages: it extracts it and, having no
#     patches/series, reports "staging done" -- the extraction + sha256 is the
#     reachability/hash verification). Everything the build actually needs that
#     is NOT in that tarball is pinned here by git commit: WINE_COMMIT,
#     WINE_STAGING_COMMIT, PIPEWIRE_COMMIT and the other submodule gitlinks.
#   * pkg/build.sh does its own staging of the wine tree (protonprep) inside
#     the builder container -- see packages/proton-lunx/NOTES.md for the full
#     packaging rationale and the CI path.
#
# SUBMODULE POLICY (user rule): ANY submodule/remote fetch MUST be shallow
# (`git fetch --depth 1 <remote> <sha>`), never a full clone. pkg/build.sh
# follows this everywhere (wine in particular is multi-GB full).
#
# Pins (recorded 2026-08-21 from a shallow clone of the tag):
#   GE-Proton11-4 top-level commit 7855e7f05ecf8eabc582d1c12d8df79de85a0e12
#   wine         36078f5f947532885a596dabbc7893c048133660
#   wine-staging 6cc805ea57132eeaf44764e9213823c9b8d0d300
#   pipewire     d20a1523b6770dfa93a270bdda5d7c800d7ec191   (pipewire 1.4.2; the
#                 aux-channel patch applies cleanly -- verified 2026-08-21)
#   dxvk         3a4c6fa3cb1548d56a90a38dd8f526b6c13e63fd
#   vkd3d-proton 731c4aae5991b33f2ddab45d3cb1b4779159bf4b
#   dxvk-nvapi   48bdcceb16eabb5d1d1a4f9da261f29e33409503
#   vkd3d        44faa3ac05ed43332fedffb4d6c0cda99abd720f
#   ffmpeg       9047fa1b084f76b1b4d065af2d743df1b40dfb56
#   dav1d        b546257f770768b2c88258c533da38b91a06f737
#   graphene     4e2578450809c2099400cf85caf18eafcd7100aa
#   libxkbcommon dd642359f8d43c09968e34ca7f1eb1121b2dfd70
#   openvr       91825305130f446f82054c1ec3d416321ace0072
#   protonfixes  129e2b0743a460f29b6b754918d7c7ad7f770f03
#   bzip2        6a8690fc8d26c815e798c588f796eabe9d684cf0
#   xz           4b73f2ec19a99ef465282fbce633e8deb33691b3
#
# VERSION is the GE tag + the lunx suffix; it becomes the compatibilitytools.d
# directory name and the tarball name.
VERSION=GE-Proton11-4-lunx

# --- top-level pin (what tools/stage.sh stages + hashes) ---
SOURCE_URL="${SOURCE_URL:-https://github.com/GloriousEggroll/proton-ge-custom/archive/refs/tags/GE-Proton11-4.tar.gz}"
SOURCE_TARBALL="${SOURCE_TARBALL:-GE-Proton11-4.tar.gz}"
# sha256 of the codeload tarball above, computed 2026-08-21. SOURCE_URL may
# move (e.g. to the LAN blob store); SOURCE_SHA256 is deliberately not
# overridable -- the bytes are the pin.
SOURCE_SHA256=4230e9b7cc099fcbcc1b117fba3241a5fbf0ca51c886c87613afe53d672905fc

# --- submodule pins (git SHAs; shallow-fetched by pkg/build.sh) ---
GE_COMMIT=7855e7f05ecf8eabc582d1c12d8df79de85a0e12
WINE_COMMIT=36078f5f947532885a596dabbc7893c048133660
WINE_STAGING_COMMIT=6cc805ea57132eeaf44764e9213823c9b8d0d300
PIPEWIRE_COMMIT=d20a1523b6770dfa93a270bdda5d7c800d7ec191
DXVK_COMMIT=3a4c6fa3cb1548d56a90a38dd8f526b6c13e63fd
VKD3D_PROTON_COMMIT=731c4aae5991b33f2ddab45d3cb1b4779159bf4b
DXVK_NVAPI_COMMIT=48bdcceb16eabb5d1d1a4f9da261f29e33409503
VKD3D_COMMIT=44faa3ac05ed43332fedffb4d6c0cda99abd720f
FFMPEG_COMMIT=9047fa1b084f76b1b4d065af2d743df1b40dfb56
DAV1D_COMMIT=b546257f770768b2c88258c533da38b91a06f737
GRAPHENE_COMMIT=4e2578450809c2099400cf85caf18eafcd7100aa
LIBXKBCOMMON_COMMIT=dd642359f8d43c09968e34ca7f1eb1121b2dfd70
OPENVR_COMMIT=91825305130f446f82054c1ec3d416321ace0072
PROTONFIXES_COMMIT=129e2b0743a460f29b6b754918d7c7ad7f770f03
BZIP2_COMMIT=6a8690fc8d26c815e798c588f796eabe9d684cf0
XZ_COMMIT=4b73f2ec19a99ef465282fbce633e8deb33691b3
